Practice boards
===============

Five projects copied from the KiCad source tree, demos/ (KiCad 10.99, fork branch web-api),
for the board-practice pass and the router comparison (docs/06-routing.md):

  ecc83/          demos/ecc83          two projects (ecc83-pp, ecc83-pp_v2), 3d_shapes/ dropped
  sonde_xilinx/   demos/sonde xilinx   directory renamed (no space); the files keep their names
  interf_u/       demos/interf_u       includes the tux legacy symbol lib, the .kicad_wks and tux.bmp
  pic_programmer/ demos/pic_programmer libs/3d_shapes/ dropped
  stickhub/       demos/stickhub       3dmodels/ dropped, LICENSE.md and README.md kept

Dropped everywhere: *-backups/, *.kicad_prl, fp-info-cache, 3D model directories. The
footprint tables that point at ${KICAD10_FOOTPRINT_DIR} (pic_programmer) need that variable
set to a KiCad footprint library install.

Every `<name>.unrouted.kicad_pcb` (with its `<name>.unrouted.kicad_pro`) is generated from
the board next to it by `strip-routes.ts` (this directory): tracks, track arcs and vias
removed, zone fills dropped, zone outlines and settings kept. Regenerate with
`bun e2e/fixtures/boards/strip-routes.ts`; `--check` reports stale variants.

